<title>POLAND: Polish grain prices fall, livestock rise in August.</title>
<headline>Polish grain prices fall, livestock rise in August.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish grain procurement prices</p>
<p>fell in August while pork and cattle prices rose, the Central</p>
<p>Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p> POLISH FARM GOODS PRICES		AUGUST     JULY   AUGUST 95</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		  56.42     64.53    32.97</p>
<p>   month/month pct change	     -12.6	-0.3     -0.6</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			71.1	94.6     43.1</p>
<p>RYE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		  35.11     39.63    21.60</p>
<p>   month/month pct change	     -11.4	 1.0     -1.6</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			62.6	80.5     31.1</p>
<p>CATTLE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg			 2.59	2.55     2.41</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		 1.6	 0.9	5.4</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			 7.7	11.8     34.3</p>
<p>PORK</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg			 3.38	3.11     2.67</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		 8.9	12.7	9.0</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			26.6	26.8	4.7</p>
<p>--Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
